        <mxCell id="b21" value="The frontend calls auth and roadmap server-side, so the browser only ever talks to port 80. The same EC2 also serves the Argo CD UI (ivolve-argocd.denmarkeast.cloudapp.azure.com) and runs cloudflared for the https tunnel." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FBFBFB;strokeColor=#5A6C86;strokeWidth=1.5;dashed=1;fontColor=#232F3E;fontSize=17;fontStyle=1;verticalAlign=middle;align=center;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
